.TH PSAddInputLayer 3 2023-12-11 "PsyC 0.9.3" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
\fBPSAddInputLayer\fR

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/psyc.h>

.I
PSLayer  *
.br
\fBPSAddInputLayer\fR(\fIPSModel *model\fR, \fIint size\fR, \fIPSLayerDef *ldef\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add input layer of size \fIsize\fR to \fImodel\fR. The layer type will be set to the default \fIFullyConnected\fR type.
.br
Special layer properties can be defined by the optional argument \fIlayer_def\fR.
.br
If \fIlayer_def\fR is \fINULL\fR, the function will use the default layer configuration.
.br
See \fIPSAddLayer\fR for further details about adding layers.  

.SH RETURN VALUES
The added layer or \fINULL\fR if:

.RS 4
\[bu] \fImodel\fR is \fINULL\fR.
.br

\[bu] \fImodel\fR is not empty.
.br

\[bu] See \fIPSAddLayer\fR for more failure reasons.
.br
.RE

.SH SEE ALSO
psyc(1), PSAddLayer(3)
